<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Приложение Битрикс24</title>
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px; color: #17212b; background: #f3f6f8; }
        main { width: min(100%, 520px); text-align: center; }
        h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 36px); line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <h1>Откройте приложение из Битрикс24</h1>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
